sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant F as Flask
  participant S as MySQL
  participant M as MongoDB
  B->>F: POST /api/checkout
  F->>M: read cart and version
  F->>S: BEGIN
  F->>S: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE (ascending product_id)
  alt stock too low, or any error
    F->>S: ROLLBACK
    F-->>B: 409 with the shirts that fell short
  else all steps succeed
    F->>S: UPDATE products (deduct stock)
    F->>S: INSERT orders, order_items, sync_outbox
    F->>S: COMMIT
    F->>M: start transaction: clear cart, log, notify
    alt MongoDB commits
      F->>S: mark outbox event done
    else MongoDB fails
      M--xF: abort, nothing written
      F->>S: event stays pending for replay
    end
    F-->>B: 201 order created
  end
